AB  - Geological survey methods have been importantly applied and attempted in the field of mineral exploration. This paper compared and analyzed several typical geological survey methods and proposes a mineral exploration method based on UAV remote sensing technology and deep learning image recognition. By combining the super-pixel segmentation algorithm and CNN model, the efficiency and accuracy of remote sensing image feature recognition were improved, and the finding efficiency of mineral exploration was enhanced. The practical application results showed that the proposed method had a good performance in terms of mineral finding accuracy and applicability, and could make up for the shortcomings of traditional geological survey methods in mineral exploration.
